menu "NoiseBot head display"

    config NB_HEAD_DISPLAY_ENABLED
        bool "Enable DM2 head display service"
        default n
        help
            Enables only the semantic receiver and capability advertisement.
            LovyanGFX and physical display GPIO remain deferred until the DM2
            hardware gate.

    config NB_HEAD_DISPLAY_HW_ENABLED
        bool "Enable physical ST7789 display on head"
        depends on NB_HEAD_DISPLAY_ENABLED
        default n
        help
            Initializes LovyanGFX on SPI2 using GPIO47 SCLK, GPIO21 MOSI and
            GPIO45 DC. Enable only after the DM2 electrical gate. The regular
            DM2 semantic profile keeps this disabled.

endmenu
